abstract: >-
  Evidence-bounded, auditable mechanism adjudication under partial observability
  for patient-level cancer molecular data. This public proof layer exposes the
  minimum executable surface needed to inspect manuscript-facing MEJIP 1.0
  evidence-entitlement and adjudication behavior.
keywords:
  - bioinformatics
  - systems biology
  - cancer genomics
  - mechanism inference
  - partial observability
  - reproducible research
